  "hints": [
    "Pad A is far from the gate, so you cannot hold the pad and cross the gate yourself. Your echo can hold the pad while you walk through the gate.",
    "Switch on LIFT-POWER and record from the console: walk three tiles left and one down onto pad A, wait once, and save with {key:echo}. Launch with {key:echo}, then walk east to the elevator."
